%[text] | <p></p><p>![](text:image:685f)</p> | <p>**In this script, students will...**</p><p>$\\bullet$ calculate genetic distances between species</p><p>$\\bullet$ visualize genetic distance using phylogenetic trees</p><p>$\\bullet$ use genetic data to interpret evolutionary relationships</p> | <p>**Academic disciplines**</p><p>$\\bullet$ Biology</p> |
